      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Potencia los movimientos de tipo Tierra, Acero y Roca durante las tormentas de arena.",
        "en": "During a sandstorm, this Pokémon's Rock-, Ground-, and Steel-type moves have 1.3× their base power. This Pokémon does not take sandstorm damage, regardless of type."
